  "prefLabel": "Fis 1003.01 Avoidance of Harm",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1003.01 Avoidance of Harm. Pursuant to RSA 212-A:9, III, all proposed actions shall be designed to avoid and minimize harm to threatened and endangered species and habitat determined to be critical, including any proposed mitigation of harm or other potential adverse impacts to wildlife.\n\nSource. #13313, eff 2-3-22",
